IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `cbs-corporation`

-- Christian Brothers' Schools Visitor Ordinance 1915, ss 2-5 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_christian-brothers-schools-visitor-ordinance-1915.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`Brother James himself` MEANS Claimant WITH
    `is James Joseph Byrne` IS TRUE
    `holds the office of Visitor` IS TRUE
    `has the Minister's approval under hand and seal` IS FALSE
    `has filed the constituting instrument in the Supreme Court Registry` IS FALSE
    `filing is notified in the Gazette` IS FALSE

`a successor approved, filed and gazetted` MEANS Claimant WITH
    `is James Joseph Byrne` IS FALSE
    `holds the office of Visitor` IS TRUE
    `has the Minister's approval under hand and seal` IS TRUE
    `has filed the constituting instrument in the Supreme Court Registry` IS TRUE
    `filing is notified in the Gazette` IS TRUE

`a successor approved and filed but not yet gazetted` MEANS Claimant WITH
    `is James Joseph Byrne` IS FALSE
    `holds the office of Visitor` IS TRUE
    `has the Minister's approval under hand and seal` IS TRUE
    `has filed the constituting instrument in the Supreme Court Registry` IS TRUE
    `filing is notified in the Gazette` IS FALSE

`a successor filed and gazetted without the Minister's approval` MEANS Claimant WITH
    `is James Joseph Byrne` IS FALSE
    `holds the office of Visitor` IS TRUE
    `has the Minister's approval under hand and seal` IS FALSE
    `has filed the constituting instrument in the Supreme Court Registry` IS TRUE
    `filing is notified in the Gazette` IS TRUE

`a successor approved but whose instrument was never filed` MEANS Claimant WITH
    `is James Joseph Byrne` IS FALSE
    `holds the office of Visitor` IS TRUE
    `has the Minister's approval under hand and seal` IS TRUE
    `has filed the constituting instrument in the Supreme Court Registry` IS FALSE
    `filing is notified in the Gazette` IS FALSE

`an appointed Visitor who has done nothing yet` MEANS Claimant WITH
    `is James Joseph Byrne` IS FALSE
    `holds the office of Visitor` IS TRUE
    `has the Minister's approval under hand and seal` IS FALSE
    `has filed the constituting instrument in the Supreme Court Registry` IS FALSE
    `filing is notified in the Gazette` IS FALSE

`a conveyance sealed before and signed by Brother James` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `is sealed with the Corporation seal` IS TRUE
    `sealed in the presence of` IS `James Joseph Byrne`
    `signed by` IS `James Joseph Byrne`

`a mortgage sealed before and signed by Byrne's deposited attorney` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `is sealed with the Corporation seal` IS TRUE
    `sealed in the presence of` IS `Byrne's attorney under a deposited power of attorney`
    `signed by` IS `Byrne's attorney under a deposited power of attorney`

`a lease sealed before and signed by a qualified successor` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `is sealed with the Corporation seal` IS TRUE
    `sealed in the presence of` IS `a duly qualified successor Visitor`
    `signed by` IS `a duly qualified successor Visitor`

`a deed sealed before a qualified successor and signed by his deposited attorney` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `is sealed with the Corporation seal` IS TRUE
    `sealed in the presence of` IS `a duly qualified successor Visitor`
    `signed by` IS `a successor's attorney under a deposited power of attorney`

`a deed sealed before and signed by a successor's deposited attorney` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `is sealed with the Corporation seal` IS TRUE
    `sealed in the presence of` IS `a successor's attorney under a deposited power of attorney`
    `signed by` IS `a successor's attorney under a deposited power of attorney`

`a transfer sealed before and signed by an undeposited attorney` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `is sealed with the Corporation seal` IS TRUE
    `sealed in the presence of` IS `an attorney whose power of attorney is not deposited`
    `signed by` IS `an attorney whose power of attorney is not deposited`

`a deed sealed before and signed by a successor not yet gazetted` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `is sealed with the Corporation seal` IS TRUE
    `sealed in the presence of` IS `a successor Visitor not yet gazetted`
    `signed by` IS `a successor Visitor not yet gazetted`

`a deed sealed before a school Director and signed by Brother James` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `is sealed with the Corporation seal` IS TRUE
    `sealed in the presence of` IS `a school Director with no power of attorney`
    `signed by` IS `James Joseph Byrne`

`a document signed by Brother James but never sealed` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `is sealed with the Corporation seal` IS FALSE
    `sealed in the presence of` IS `James Joseph Byrne`
    `signed by` IS `James Joseph Byrne`

`a deed sealed before Brother James but signed by nobody` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `is sealed with the Corporation seal` IS TRUE
    `sealed in the presence of` IS `James Joseph Byrne`
    `signed by` IS `nobody`

